window.EN={"1":"Castle Araphen, located just north of the Pherae domain.","2":"The Lycian Alliance had first gathered its main force here, and continued to deliberate over how to deal with Bern.","3":"Roy's army, bringing along Guinivere, the woman who held the key to this war,","4":"hurried to join up with the Alliance.","5":"But when they had closed to within half a day's distance of Castle Araphen,","6":"a messenger rushed in from the castle bearing urgent news,","7":"and told Roy and the others something they could hardly believe.","8":"\"The Lycian Alliance army was struck by the forces of two of Bern's finest valiant generals, known as the Three Dragon Generals of Bern —","9":"General Brunya and General Narshen — and suffered a defeat close to annihilation\" ...so it was said.","10":"The sudden defeat of the proud, mighty Lycian Alliance... even as he reeled in shock at the fact,","11":"Roy pressed on toward Castle Araphen, determined to confirm the extent of the damage and whether anyone had survived.","12":"Your Majesty. I have brought the enemy's leader.","13":"Bring him before me.","14":"Ngh...! Y-you're... King Zephiel of Bern!!","15":"Damn you... how dare you...","16":"Lord Hector of Ostia.","17":"To think you fought this far against two of our Bernese Dragon Generals.","18":"As befits the leader of the Lycian Alliance, I'd like to say... but...","19":"No matter how one valiant man struggles, in the end, this is as far as it goes.","20":"You'd do well to accept that.","21":"Why...","22":"Hm?","23":"My people of Lycia have, for generations, enjoyed good relations with our neighbor Bern...","24":"Even after King Zephiel took the throne, we never once neglected proper courtesy.","25":"And yet... why...","26":"Courtesy? Hmph. Don't speak of such trivial things.","27":"The Lycia region... no, this entire continent, must be ruled by me.","28":"So that I may \"liberate\" the world.","29":"For that purpose, I have no time to waste clinging to trifling things like \"courtesy.\"","30":"\"Liberate\"... you say?","31":"That's no concern of a dying man like you. Is anyone there!","32":"Throw the Marquess of Ostia into the dungeon below!","33":"Yes, sir!","34":"Well then, Your Majesty, I shall return to the Sacae plains.","35":"Mm, I'm counting on you.","36":"...Your Majesty, forgive my impertinence, but perhaps it would be wise not to place such trust in that suspicious one...","37":"You mean Idoun?","38":"Among the soldiers, many have taken to calling her the \"Priestess of Darkness,\"","39":"and quite a few of them regard her presence with unease or outright loathing.","40":"However skilled a shaman she may be...","41":"Brunya. Do you doubt my judgment?","42":"N-no, not at all! I only meant...","43":"Then you need only follow my orders. Is that clear?","44":"...Yes. Everything shall be as Your Majesty wishes...","45":"\"Do you doubt me,\" is it... Hmph, even I say such foolish things sometimes.","46":"Is it true that Lord Hector is alive!?","47":"Yeah, no mistake about it.","48":"I saw it with my own eyes — Bernese soldiers taking him into the castle.","49":"It's Chad, wasn't it?","50":"Do you know the inside of Castle Araphen well?","51":"Well, sort of.","52":"...Wait, don't tell me you lot are actually planning to go rescue him?","53":"You'd be better off giving that up.","54":"Looks like the main force went off somewhere, but there's still a fair number of troops left behind, you know?","55":"With just this army, it'd be like walking right into your own deaths.","56":"I know.","57":"But we can't afford to lose the Marquess of Ostia.","58":"Besides, the main force isn't there, is it? Then we do have a chance of winning.","59":"I see...","60":"Well then, guess I'll tag along too — I'll show you around inside the castle.","61":"Huh!? You don't have to push yourself.","62":"If you could just tell us the castle's layout, that'd be enough...","63":"Me too... I've got a grudge against Bern.","64":"Let me fight alongside you, alright?","65":"Understood.","66":"In that case, I'll be counting on you.","67":"Heheh, now that's more like it! Leave the door-lock picking and the treasure chests to me!!","68":"...Lord Roy. I'm sorry — my brother...","69":"I never imagined he'd invade Lycia this soon... I... what should I...","70":"Princess, there's no use dwelling on what's already happened. Please don't blame yourself too much.","71":"Besides, Lycia is still alright. As long as we can rescue Lord Hector safely — the Alliance's leader and its linchpin —","72":"Lycia can become one again and fight on!","73":"That's exactly why we absolutely must retake this castle, Araphen.","74":"Yes... for Lilina's sake too...","75":"......","76":"Everyone, let's go!!","77":"Alright, Father, I'll leave everyone in your care.","78":"Yes. We of the Church of Elimine will take full responsibility for watching over the orphans.","79":"Lugh, what will you do?","80":"I'm going to stay in this village a little longer. There's still something I need to do.","81":"I see... Please don't push yourself too hard.","82":"Yes. Thank you very much.","83":"Everyone, be sure to listen well to what the Father tells you.","84":"Big brother Lugh, aren't you coming with us?","85":"I'm going to wait for Chad, and then catch up with everyone after...","86":"Yay! Is big brother Chad coming too?","87":"That's right.","88":"Then, then, I'd love it if big brother Rey came along too!","89":"Yeah... it'd be nice if Rey comes back too, so everyone could go together.","90":"Alright, everyone, let's get going.","91":"See you later, big brother Lugh.","92":"Come quick, okay!","93":"Mm...","94":"Sorry, everyone.","95":"But I've decided — I won't run away anymore.","96":"Narshen!","97":"...Something seems to be causing a commotion?","98":"It's probably just the enemy's remnants making a fuss. It's nothing — mere stragglers not worth troubling over.","99":"Your Majesty, shall we make use of the \"dragons\"?","100":"No — even without borrowing the Priestess of Darkness's power, we can handle this ourselves...","101":"......","102":"Idoun, this time it's fine. Send the dragons back to Bern as planned.","103":"Yes. If that is Your Majesty's wish.","104":"......","105":"Well then, let us also return to Bern. Narshen, I leave Lycia's affairs to you.","106":"...What shall I do with the remnants of Lycia?","107":"Cut down any who defy us, their whole families along with them.","108":"Women and children too... I take it?","109":"Of course. Be thorough about it, until Bern's enemies lose all will to resist.","110":"As you command. Kuh-huh-huh...","111":"Hmph, what on earth does His Majesty see in that little girl.","112":"Well then, I suppose I'll be on my way too. Slater, I leave this castle to you.","113":"Are you heading out?","114":"Yes. It seems those traitors among the Lycian lords","115":"have prepared something rather amusing for me.","116":"Apparently the daughter of some Etrurian noble, or so I hear... kuh-huh-huh.","117":"A girl from Etruria... she must be quite beautiful, I'd imagine.","118":"Ah, she still has a bit of childishness about her, but I hear she's quite a beauty.","119":"That does sound like something to look forward to. Please do be careful on the road.","120":"Slater, you too — don't let the remnants of Lycia catch you off guard.","121":"Should anything like that happen, I myself will tear you to pieces.","122":"O-oh, you're teasing me...","123":"Kuh-huh-huh...","124":"(If visited with Chad)","125":"Chad! Thank goodness — you're safe!!","126":"Lugh!? Why are you in a place like this?","127":"I escaped here together with everyone.","128":"I see... So, is everyone safe?","129":"Yeah, the Church of Elimine agreed to look after them for the time being.","130":"What about you?","131":"Eh?","132":"Why are you the only one who stayed behind here?","133":"...The same reason as Chad.","134":"!? Lugh, you don't mean...!","135":"I can use a little bit of magic too, you know.","136":"See, there was just one tome of \"Fire\" magic in the headmaster's room, so...","137":"Lugh, don't push yourself. You can't bring yourself to hurt people, can you?","138":"But...","139":"I'll be the one to avenge the headmaster. You stay with everyone else, Lugh.","140":"I don't want to just keep hiding anymore! Before I even know it, everyone, everyone just disappears.","141":"The headmaster, Chad... even Rey... I want to fight for the people who matter to me too.","142":"Not just be protected — I want to protect too!!","143":"Lugh...","144":"...Alright, fine. Then come with me.","145":"I'll ask around to see if we can get you into that guy Roy's army.","146":"Chad! Thank you!!","147":"I really understand how you feel.","148":"Since it's come to this, let's hurry and defeat Bern so we can go bring everyone back!","149":"Yeah!","150":"(If visited by someone other than Chad)","151":"Um... you're with the Lycian army fighting against Bern... right?","152":"P-please! Let me fight alongside you too!!","153":"I might not look very dependable, but I can use a little magic!","154":"I want to help protect everyone from Bern too — please, I'm begging you!","155":"Chad! Thank goodness — you're safe!!","156":"Lugh!? Why are you in a place like this?","157":"I escaped here together with everyone.","158":"I see... So, is everyone safe?","159":"Yeah, the Church of Elimine agreed to look after them for the time being.","160":"What about you?","161":"Eh?","162":"Why are you the only one who stayed behind here?","163":"...The same reason as Chad.","164":"!? Lugh, you don't mean...!","165":"I can use a little bit of magic too, you know.","166":"See, there was just one tome of \"Fire\" magic in the headmaster's room, so...","167":"Lugh, don't push yourself. You can't bring yourself to hurt people, can you?","168":"But...","169":"I'll be the one to avenge the headmaster. You stay with everyone else, Lugh.","170":"I don't want to just keep hiding anymore! Before I even know it, everyone, everyone just disappears.","171":"The headmaster, Chad... even Rey... I want to fight for the people who matter to me too.","172":"Not just be protected — I want to protect too!!","173":"Lugh...","174":"Alright, since it's come to this, let's hurry and defeat Bern so we can go bring everyone back!","175":"Yeah!","176":"You lot — are you survivors of the Lycian army?","177":"Here, take this and hurry along — this area's full of Bernese soldiers.","178":"This area has been taken over by Bern, but...","179":"we're on the side of you Lycian folks, you know!","180":"Hmph, I won't lose! A-and if I do lose...","181":"Eeek!","182":"P-please forgive me... Lord Narshen...!","183":"Lord Roy, the Marquess of Ostia was in the castle's dungeon!","184":"I see! And? He's safe, isn't he?","185":"Well... he's been gravely wounded...","186":"Roy, is it...","187":"Lord Hector!! That wound... how terrible...!","188":"We need to treat it right away! Please, lean on my shoulder.","189":"It's fine... I don't have much longer...","190":"Lord Hector...","191":"...I was careless.","192":"To think Bern had revived dragons...","193":"Dragons, you say!?","194":"That's right... dragons that we humans once... fought against, long ago...","195":"You mean the \"War of Dragons and Men\"? I've heard of that too.","196":"The war fought long ago over supremacy between the human race and the dragon race who once divided this continent of Elibe...","197":"That's right... through the efforts of the heroes called the \"Eight Legends\"...","198":"in the end, humanity... was victorious...","199":"Yes, and the dragons were said to have vanished from this continent after that.","200":"...I had always believed dragons were just creatures out of legend.","201":"Everyone must have believed that... but dragons do exist... they're not something one can fight normally.","202":"How... did Bern manage to make use of dragons?","203":"I don't know... but the land where the dragons once flourished... was Bern...","204":"And Bern's... founding king was... one of the \"Eight Legends\"... Hartmut...","205":"Perhaps somewhere in that... lies the reason... *cough* *cough*","206":"Lord Hector!","207":"Roy... head to Ostia.","208":"And... in my place... please command the army remaining in Ostia...","209":"That's... too much for me, I...","210":"It'll be fine... Ostia has... a weapon that works against dragons too...","211":"A weapon... you mean?","212":"...My daughter, Lilina, has already been told about it...","213":"And... please look after my daughter as well...","214":"...Even if she puts on a brave face, she's still just a child...","215":"I need you... to support her...","216":"...Understood. You can count on me.","217":"...Lilina, just once more... I wanted to see her...","218":"Lord Hector!!"};
